  "handoff": {
    "summary": "Generated exact-size callee-owned pivot-column byte-region queries for borrowed FmpzMatrix and FmpqMatrix resources. Direct adapters, source-transparent native and native-disabled paths, empty, all-zero, full-rank, and huge-exact-value matrices, deterministic close, use-after-close rejection, external-memory accounting, and sanitizer-backed lifecycle stress are covered without changing the public Matrix API. Independent review approved the ABI, semantics, ownership, and portability design with no blockers.",
    "risks": [
      "The new declarations are portable by construction and declare wasm=True, but this lane does not add a browser-facing public Matrix consumer; the portable suite remains the lowering gate.",
      "A broad pnpm test:changed run reached unrelated baseline failures: compiler/algebra.py timed out and compiler/matrix.py hit the existing sparse-random iterator defect. The focused compiled pivot witness and all FFI tests pass."
    ],
    "next_steps": [
      "Integrate the generated pivot queries into public exact Matrix.pivots/echelon consumers in a separate lane.",
      "Exercise the new functions through the browser public wrapper when exact matrix resources are wired there."
    ]
  }
